\subsection{Objective Function}
\label{sec:objectives}

The program has exactly one objective: it minimises total passenger delay.
Every other quantity is a cap or a monitor, never a second objective.  All
clocks are integer ($\Delta t = 1$); the delay quantities below are built from
the veh\,s variables $D_{i,s,v,t}$, converted to passenger-seconds by the
occupancies $\rho_{\text{bus}} = 40$, $\rho_{\text{car}} = 1.2$.

