scenario on seeds 300--700 at demand $\times$1.0 (learners pre-trained on
seeds 800--1100, frozen), and we report realised microsimulation outcomes
against the \texttt{NO\_TSP} baseline--never MILP-predicted values.  The
paper's $Z_1$--$Z_4$ labels are shorthand for standard TSP quantities, not
bespoke metrics; the ``custom'' terms name \emph{controller internals} (the
